  "changes": [
    "Voice Mode can speak one brief acknowledgment in the selected language while an answer is pending. A running lookup gets a search cue, and quick answers take priority. Speech model preparation overlaps audio setup, and stable opening words can play during a provider pause.",
    "Use one capacity-bound context plan before optional repository context, with a usable tool replay reserve, current-request protection, compact schema staging and retention of the previous user request.",
    "Keep compact GitHub overflow compact, bound recent-commit reporting to observed rows, advance repeated saved cursors only from proven progress, and preserve evidence identity through review projections.",
    "Bind CI discovery and summaries to the selected commit, scope and freshness window; require complete pagination before reporting a complete inventory.",
    "Support commit-SHA all-checks watches, recover invalid watch selections before dispatch, and let independent pinned reads complete while preserving write ordering.",
    "Use bounded visible-output recovery for automatic mechanical GitHub work while preserving explicit Deep/Maximum reasoning choices and existing output ceilings.",
    "Prioritize first-party source and tests over vendored trees, version index cursors, and qualify bounded graph samples with honest partial-coverage reports.",
    "Isolate settled transcript rows from unrelated progress changes, avoid redundant layout updates, and report delivered frame callbacks and observation gaps.",
    "Reuse identical redacted diagnostic bodies without losing event envelopes; verify body references and record detailed protected-export phase durations.",
    "Classify quota failures including HTTP 200 error envelopes, retain bounded credential-scoped recovery delays, offer verified provider billing links, and group repeated pending quota incidents with immutable approval identities.",
    "Retry passive MCP discovery after a saved connection revision repairs configuration, while preserving per-connection backoff and native GitHub isolation.",
    "Qualify the recognized ChatML reasoning toggle with exact synthetic-turn boundaries, distinguish unrecognized controls from unsupported controls, preserve explicit Off, and provide selected-model load/recheck recovery with stale-selection cancellation.",
    "Unify repository scope in ordinary and GitHub chat; enable verified Gateway engineering owners while preserving explicit pauses/revocations, avoid unchanged-settings database writes, and keep profile/model selection fixed through foreground and queued preparation.",
    "Carry one effective context ceiling and provenance through GitHub planning, replay admission, continuation and provider serialization, reserving a usable evidence envelope.",
    "Refresh and restore exact OpenRouter alias metadata with its original observation age, and use the lowest advertised compatible reasoning effort for AUTO visible delivery while retaining explicit fixed settings.",
    "Complete trusted direct lookups and current-revision CI observations through the existing verification gate before another provider round; retain selected source identity and canonical CI evidence coverage.",
    "Separate durable provider waits, tool handoffs, transport recovery and output/no-progress allowances, retaining original failure details and useful partial reports across restart.",
    "Reuse immutable repository source and lexical reference catalogs across tasks, select bounded caller/test/configuration neighborhoods, and show prepared excerpt coverage.",
    "Expose accepted qualification scope and distinct passed, blocked, untested, failed and excluded capability counts with exact prerequisite groups.",
    "Apply the same request-scoped GitHub planning and verification to native plugin chat and GitHub mode. Stage schemas and replay within verified model limits, recover from bounded output and provider waits, and watch checks at a specified commit.",
    "Enable engineering for verified gateway owners by default, restore the route and wake the selected local model on send. Preserve grants and maintenance pauses and avoid database writes when polling unchanged owner settings.",
    "Add behavioral regression coverage for the recorded budget, completion, repeated-wait, evidence-reuse, source-selection and qualification scenarios.",
    "Keep spoken replies playing across app and conversation navigation, with a stop control. Use language-specific voices and dictionaries, retain compatible GPU/NPU routes, and allow up to 16 native CPU threads subject to device capacity.",
    "Recover missing pull-request list and changed-file pages at their verified revision, restart implicit traversals when the head changes, and report deadlines with the remaining work.",
    "Preserve a queued final answer across a background acknowledgment, recognize French punctuation spacing, and keep automatic microphone and playback activity in another chat from interrupting speech. The playback notification opens the original message on each tap."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Unified Reliability v2 is not complete; this scoped release does not certify the broader milestone or unexecuted scenarios.",
    "Physical Android frame timing, export latency, model behavior and Windows-to-phone networking still require measurements on the target device and services. Automated regressions establish their tested behavior only.",
    "Provider balances, account/project/key limits, external rate limits and unavailable servers remain external conditions. Recovery controls do not replenish quota or override a provider rejection.",
    "Explicit local reasoning On/Off remains blocked unless the exact selected model and runtime provide a recognized, fresh template-control proof. Auto must be selected explicitly when that proof is unavailable.",
    "Bounded graph qualification demonstrates the selected first-party sample; it does not claim that every file or repository integration was exercised.",
    "French pronunciation, sustained background audio, GPU/NPU performance and end-to-end speech latency still require physical handset qualification. Host regressions exercise language selection, streaming and service ownership, acknowledgment handoff, parallel audio preparation, CPU thread scheduling and accelerator fallback.",
    "Unified Reliability v2 is not complete. This release qualifies the scoped GitHub mode and repository-context changes; broader program acceptance remains independent.",
    "Live provider answer quality, remote token savings and physical-phone latency require matched measurements. Deterministic and hosted regressions do not establish a measured intelligence score or superiority over another coding product.",
    "Repository caller, import, test and configuration relationships are bounded lexical candidates. Prepared source excerpts may be trimmed by final request admission and do not establish exhaustive repository coverage, compiler resolution or executed tests.",
    "OpenRouter capabilities are bound to the observed exact model ID and freshness window. Unsupported or custom-route capabilities remain unknown; explicit fixed reasoning settings retain their selected behavior.",
    "Qualification prerequisites, uncertain writes and missing source or execution evidence remain explicit. Recovery does not expand permissions, replay uncertain mutations or convert unfinished acceptance criteria into success.",
    "The repository and gateway regressions include simulated transports. Physical handset execution and live side-by-side model quality have not been measured for these changes. Provider quota and explicit reasoning-off support depend on the selected backend."
  ],
